{
  "description": "E208 paired indexed-cache controllers: A source-owner rounds, B four direction/parity phases. Identical balanced adjacent-owner graph, coefficients, features, ordered consumer and wire payload. C8/R2 minimum and C32/R3/K6/G3 odd-tail gates precede active-owner R4/R16/R64/R128 and R4/D16. ABBAAB repeats at R4/D1 and R128/D1; AB elsewhere. Complete immutable-input, numerical, counter and same-PE-clock audit follows every run. R128 is the current host-contract limit, not a measured hardware frontier. No training or whole-GNN speedup claim.",
